// FeeThreshold_V1 — Privacy-preserving fee threshold proof
//
// Proves: fee >= threshold without revealing fee.
// Public inputs: threshold (Base), tx_binding (Base)
// Constraint: range_check(64, fee - threshold)
//
// If fee < threshold, the subtraction underflows in pallas::Base
// (producing a value near p - (threshold - fee)), which fails the
// 64-bit range check.
//
// Circuit: k=11, field=pallas (matches Fee_V2, FeeCollect_V1)
// Spec: fee-spec.md §5.5
//
// Status: STUB — full ZK circuit implementation pending.
// This file defines the circuit interface for the type system.
